-- ✅ البحث المرن القديم (يبحث بجزء من الاسم أو اسم العرض ويضيفهم ويمسح خانة البحث)
SearchBox.FocusLost:Connect(function()
    local searchText = SearchBox.Text:lower():gsub("^%s*(.-)%s*$", "%1")
    SearchBox.Text = ""
    if #searchText < 2 then return end

    for _, player in ipairs(Players:GetPlayers()) do
        if player.Name:lower():find(searchText) or player.DisplayName:lower():find(searchText) then
            CreateMonitorCard(player)
        end
    end
end)

Players.PlayerAdded:Connect(function(player)
    local name = player.Name
    if MonitoredPlayers[name] then
        PlayerHistory[name].Joins += 1
        PlayerTimers[name].Start = os.time()
        PlayerTimers[name].Running = true
        MonitoredPlayers[name].StatsLabel.Text = "🔢 الدخول: "..PlayerHistory[name].Joins.." | 🚪 الخروج: "..PlayerHistory[name].Leaves
        MonitoredPlayers[name].StatusLabel.Text = "🟢 متواجد الآن"
        MonitoredPlayers[name].StatusLabel.TextColor3 = Color3.fromRGB(80, 220, 120)
    end
end)

Players.PlayerRemoving:Connect(function(player)
    local name = player.Name
    if MonitoredPlayers[name] then
        PlayerHistory[name].Leaves += 1
        PlayerTimers[name].Running = false
        MonitoredPlayers[name].StatsLabel.Text = "🔢 الدخول: "..PlayerHistory[name].Joins.." | 🚪 الخروج: "..PlayerHistory[name].Leaves
        MonitoredPlayers[name].StatusLabel.Text = "🔴 غادر السيرفر"
        MonitoredPlayers[name].StatusLabel.TextColor3 = Color3.fromRGB(220, 80, 100)
    end
end)

